s finite locally free. Thus (1) holds.\nThe Noetherian case follows as a finite module over a Noetherian ring\nis a finitely presented module, see Algebra,\nLemma <REF_0004>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6bea4103d4bb302223fe10f94b0de643713a51801d70630ea2cfdb89346e2b17", "unit_id": "tag:02KB:proof"}
